<title>FINLAND: TABLE - Nokia Q2 sales by division. [CORRECTED 14:11 GMT]</title>
<headline>TABLE - Nokia Q2 sales by division. [CORRECTED 14:11 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects period in headline from H1)</p>
<p>Finnish telecoms group Nokia Oy on Monday gave the following breakdown by business group of its second-quarter net sales (FIM million):</p>
<p> NET SALES		     Q2/97    Q2/96  Change/pct</p>
<p> Telecommunications	  4,354    3,225     +35</p>
<p> Mobile Phones		 7,316    4,910     +49</p>
<p> Other operations	    1,675	979     +71</p>
<p> Intra-group eliminations   -284     -166</p>
<p> TOTAL			  13,061    8,948     +46</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245,</p>
<p>				e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
